.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"But Conelli followed very closely and on lap three he managed to pass Materassi, raising the average to 128.523 km/h. The two leading cars were almost touching.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":3,"text":"Morel covers the lap in 8m11s at 126.953 km/h.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap the independent Bugatti of Blancas stopped at the pits, losing not only third place but much ground","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":6,"text":"The BNC of Gaupillat retired after the fifth lap with a faulty valve while Fourny's BNC started to have magneto problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":9,"text":"The Argentinean Blancas retired his Bugatti after nine laps.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":11,"text":"Chiron, recovering fast, reaches fifth with a lap record of 7m26.8s, then loses the place to Martin's Amilcar while changing plugs.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":14,"text":"Materassi laps in 7m26s at 139.762 km/h.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Leblanc, who had been regaining ground, runs out of fuel.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":18,"text":"Chiron passed Martin's Amilcar and gained fifth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":21,"text":"Bernhardt with the Hudson was withdrawn after 20 laps","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":24,"text":"Fourny is stopped by the officials and excluded for disciplinary reasons.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":24,"text":"Morel retired on lap 24 when the left rear wheel seized caused by a broken ball bearing.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":28,"text":"Chiron who had continuously driven at a fast pace finally caught up with Bret, and passed him to gain fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":29,"text":"After a race long battle Jourdan passed Martinetti, who had encountered problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":32,"text":"Bret makes a brief stop and Martin takes fifth, but Bret retakes it by the end of lap 32.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":35,"text":"Materassi continued to dominate the race and had lapped everyone except his teammate Conelli.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":36,"text":"Dubonnet gets past his teammate Conelli for second place.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":39,"text":"Martinetti retired his Salmson after lap 39.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":40,"text":"Materassi wins at a record 126.637 km/h; Dubonnet, having unlapped himself, is second, 4m02s behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"When the race was stopped, de Maleplane was still driving seven laps behind and was flagged off.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7}]}